  "ownership": {
    "app": "App retains shared mutable state and buffers, controller creation, exact startup and disposal order, all existing public entries and sole writeBuffer gate. Type exports forward unchanged.",
    "buffers": "BufferOpening admits and claims buffers through live location/config/graph/following capabilities, using existing graph lookup callback. It owns no text, revision, undo or baseline.",
    "opening": "Opening owns ordered note/tab/history/floating/pinned admission through focused navigation capabilities and existing edit/cancel callbacks.",
    "layout": "ViewPolicy creates views and applies layout/cursor policy with focused live view capabilities. Existing Views keeps layout/anchor/scroll mechanisms; module WeakSet scope remains.",
    "frame": "Frame owns title and draw-failure flags; App supplies the existing drawing callback and keeps the drawing guard.",
    "entries": "No file relocation, retired path, entry, worker URL or asset move; no git mv needed. Worker implementations/requests untouched.",
    "startup": "Initial-window policy restores history/UI and opens the first windows through focused startup capabilities. Its contiguous call remains between startup warning delivery and lazy subscription, preserving exact order.",
    "messages": "Messages owns click deduplication, draw nesting and toast scheduling; App retains public messages/toasts and forwarding entries."
